SUMMARY:Science on the Carolina Coast with PBS North Carolina
DESCRIPTION:Screening and Panel Discussion\n\n\nPlease join us in-person or online on Thursday\, April 23\, at 7 PM\, for a special evening to explore Science on the Carolina Coast through stories from PBS NC original productions Sci NC and Overview. Following the screening\, enjoy a panel discussion with local subject-matter experts and answer your questions in-person and via the virtual chat. \nSci NC highlights the latest science stories from North Carolina and across the nation\, interviews leading scientists\, and engages North Carolinians with all things science. \nOverview is a nature series with an unexpected perspective. Breathtaking visuals zoom out to reveal Earth’s grand forces\, then dive in to uncover hidden stories. \n\n\n\nIN-PERSON Event Details \n\nDate and Time: Thursday\, April 23\, at 6 PM\nLocation: NC Museum of Natural Sciences (11 W. Jones Street\, Raleigh)\nDoors open at 6 PM | Refreshments will be served.\n7 PM | Screening of stories from PBS NC’s original productions Sci NC and Overview\nPanel discussion to follow\n\nVIRTUAL Event Details \n\nThursday\, April 23\, at 7 PM\nScreening of PBS NC stories from original productions Sci NC and Overview\nPanel discussion\nFrom the convenience of your own home\, office\, laptop\, computer or mobile device\nLink to join event can be found in your registration confirmation and your reminder email\nThe event will be livestreamed from the North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences\n\nModerator: Michelle Lotker\, producer\, Sci NC \nThis is a FREE\, family-friendly event\, but registration is required. Please reserve your seat or your virtual ticket by registering via Eventbrite. Questions? Email at events@pbsnc.org. \nRegister Now \nLink to join online event can be found in your registration confirmation and in your reminder email. \nSci NC is supported by a generous bequest gift from Dan Carrigan and the Gaia Earth-Balance Endowment through the Gaston Community Foundation. \nThank you to our event sponsor\, The North Carolina Science Festival\, for its generous support!
URL:https://naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/science-on-the-carolina-coast-with-pbs-north-carolina/
LOCATION:Nature Exploration Center\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Discussions,Educators,General Events,Special Events,Teens,Virtual,WRAL 3D Theater
