SUMMARY:Minibeast Adventure
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the second day of the City Nature Challenge as we venture on a special search for all creatures tiny. Who are the minibeasts? Come find out! Bring water\, whatever camera you have handy (your phone will be great!)\, and come prepared for a leisurely half mile wander through the prairie in search of insects and other tiny creatures to share to iNaturalist. This program is open to ages 8+. \nRegistration is required to attend this program. \nRegister
